that I joined TensorFlow team.

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:54.960
I'm a software engineer
on TensorFlow team,

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.980
and for TensorFlow, I have
worked on TensorFlow high level

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:02.910
